(text "The panel cable leaves on a top-entry 6-way JST PH: +5V, GND, A6, A7, D7, D8, the pin order both fascia builds\nshare. The 100 nF ladder filters on A6 and A7 sit at this end of the cable."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "5b336716-ca6f-51c1-93b1-9f9f76e789f6")
)
(text "To the fascia: JST PH, 6 ways, top entry."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 116.84 53.34 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.27 1.27)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "34aeef7e-505e-5512-b1fe-f2d510671298")
)
(text "Notes from tools/ts06pair.py"
