(bold yes)
)
(justify left top)
)
(uuid "e7eb3789-f676-555b-91b8-8525d3e8788c")
)
(text "C5: Ladder filters at the board end (spec §2).\nJ1: The panel cable; pin order is the specification both fascia builds share. Top entry, so the cable leaves\ntowards the fascia."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 69.85 0)
